That's enough.

805
00:55:20,480 --> 00:55:22,520
- Whoa.
- Wow.

806
00:55:22,600 --> 00:55:24,480
I basically paraphrased what you said.

807
00:55:24,560 --> 00:55:26,040
No, you said it well.

808
00:55:26,560 --> 00:55:27,560
Really?

809
00:55:28,080 --> 00:55:30,000
Okay. You're so cute.

810
00:55:35,080 --> 00:55:36,320
Can I take a picture of you two?

811
00:55:37,680 --> 00:55:38,680
- Sure.
- Come on.

812
00:55:38,760 --> 00:55:39,800
Here, let me.

813
00:55:44,440 --> 00:55:45,600
What are you doing?

814
00:55:46,680 --> 00:55:47,680
Taking their picture.

815
00:55:49,960 --> 00:55:51,640
Then we can show it at their wedding.

816
00:55:52,400 --> 00:55:53,480
Won't there be a whole album?

817
00:56:03,440 --> 00:56:04,280
Hey,

818
00:56:04,920 --> 00:56:05,840
why'd you take that?

819
00:56:05,920 --> 00:56:08,360
To show at our wedding?

820
00:56:14,400 --> 00:56:15,760
Wanna go behind the school?

821
00:56:18,040 --> 00:56:19,800
Let's get something to eat
for the new semester.

822
00:56:23,560 --> 00:56:24,680
You're weirdly quiet.

823
00:56:25,280 --> 00:56:26,640
What got into you?

824
00:56:28,240 --> 00:56:29,680
I was just thinking about something.

825
00:56:30,680 --> 00:56:32,840
Think we'll still be together
in 12th grade?

826
00:56:33,360 --> 00:56:34,760
Or will it be like Proud said?

827
00:56:35,600 --> 00:56:37,600
We're together today,
but we might break up someday.

828
00:56:42,840 --> 00:56:43,760
Oh, right.

829
00:56:57,480 --> 00:56:58,600
It's beautiful.

830
00:56:59,120 --> 00:57:00,480
When did you secretly get this made?

831
00:57:02,040 --> 00:57:04,000
I was gonna give it
to you on our anniversary,

832
00:57:04,640 --> 00:57:06,880
but then I thought,
I might as well give it to you now.

833
00:57:09,480 --> 00:57:10,920
And,

834
00:57:11,000 --> 00:57:12,680
if you ever want to break up with me,

835
00:57:14,400 --> 00:57:17,040
when that day comes,
I won't let you break up with me.

836
00:57:18,480 --> 00:57:20,560
You're joking around again.

837
00:57:23,360 --> 00:57:24,520
I'm not joking.

838
00:57:25,040 --> 00:57:26,240
I'm serious.

839
00:57:27,160 --> 00:57:29,360
I haven't really thought
about the future yet.

840
00:57:30,680 --> 00:57:33,240
I just know I have dreams
I want to achieve.

841
00:57:34,040 --> 00:57:35,440
I want to be a musician,

842
00:57:35,520 --> 00:57:36,880
and…

843
00:57:38,600 --> 00:57:39,480
be your boyfriend.

844
00:57:43,560 --> 00:57:45,360
You don't think about the future?

845
00:57:46,480 --> 00:57:48,840
Then my dreams are the same.

846
00:57:49,680 --> 00:57:51,080
To be an esports player

847
00:57:52,480 --> 00:57:53,880
and be your boyfriend.

848
00:57:55,880 --> 00:57:58,040
That's enough to give my life meaning.

849
00:58:21,280 --> 00:58:22,640
Hey!

850
00:58:22,720 --> 00:58:24,760
We're back!

851
00:58:24,840 --> 00:58:26,440
Let's go get something to eat.

852
00:58:34,400 --> 00:58:37,040
<i>I thought my life at</i>
<i>a former all-girls school</i>

853
00:58:37,560 --> 00:58:39,080
<i>would be impossible.</i>

854
00:58:40,160 --> 00:58:41,840
- LeeIth.
- Hello.

855
00:58:41,920 --> 00:58:44,080
<i>I thought my mom had taken</i>
<i>my teenage years away.</i>

856
00:58:44,840 --> 00:58:47,080
<i>But actually, it wasn't bad at all.</i>

857
00:58:48,920 --> 00:58:50,440
- Man, you're so slow.
- Let's go.

858
00:58:50,520 --> 00:58:52,160
Hello!

859
00:58:52,720 --> 00:58:55,680
<i>Coming to a new school</i>
<i>and trying new things</i>

860
00:58:55,760 --> 00:58:59,120
<i>gave me great opportunities,</i>
<i>great friends, and great love.</i>

861
00:59:00,120 --> 00:59:02,520
<i>Maybe that's all teenage life needs.</i>

862
00:59:22,040 --> 00:59:24,160
IF YOU HAVE A PROBLEM WITH A RULE,
TAKE IT TO COURT. DON'T TELL ME.
